msgstr ""

#: ../../../onboarding/django.rst:1002
msgid ""
"DRF's ``permission_classes = [IsAuthenticated, IsOwnerOrReadOnly]`` runs a "
"list of permission callables that return ``True`` / ``False`` per request. "
"Litestar's *guards* are callables that receive the :class:`~litestar."
"connection.ASGIConnection` and the :class:`~litestar.handlers."
"BaseRouteHandler`; raising an exception aborts the request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../onboarding/django.rst:1008
msgid "Info"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../onboarding/django.rst:1010
msgid ""
"A guard is a callable that receives the :class:`~litestar.connection."
"ASGIConnection` and the :class:`~litestar.handlers.BaseRouteHandler`; "
"raising an exception here aborts the request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../onboarding/django.rst:1015
msgid ""
"Guards are part of Litestar's layered architecture, so these can be declared "
"on applications, routers, controllers or route handlers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../onboarding/django.rst:1024
